' v1.2's surgery table (`ServiceScene`; `preset classic ai none seed 3
' start 0 party health 40`: New Sandez, the leader at 40, the companion
' handed over). The meat goes onto the table from the leader's page and the
' table stays when the page changes (`OnUpdate`); taken off on the
' companion's page it goes into his pack, and from there onto the table
' again. Back on the leader's page HEAL treats the page shown with it: the
' leader 40 -> 76, the meat gone from the companion's pack (`CommitOffer`).
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 75,303          ' into New Sandez
wait 60
mapclick 245,231         ' the doctor
wait 150
sceneclick 52,119        ' the meat, from the leader's page
pack                     ' the companion's page: the table stays
sceneclick 176,181       ' the meat off the table: into the companion's pack
sceneclick 52,119        ' and from his page onto the table
pack                     ' the leader's page again
treat                    ' HEAL: the leader, with the companion's meat
wait 3
snap doc_table
esc
wait 5
save
